Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's stay away the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.28,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, it's really\Nwhere we should be going. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And friend, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's escape with a stun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,While our dreams are never ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one of your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.26,0:01:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,we will find suspense And then commence\Nto live out another day so intense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.56,0:02:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.30,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,our minds will never give up There's a fire\Nin our dreams and you can never, never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.48,0:02:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never stop it We\Nwill be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,With this fake grape\Nmade out of Tata Babasco.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.38,0:02:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna knock her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.92,0:03:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,See if they be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.26,0:03:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He sniped a fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No room for failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Operation SOP is a go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He might be able to shoot\Na fly mid-air, but not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.70,0:03:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Dang, Leo's pretty quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he can pull this off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll rescue our captured\Ncompatriots no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Goal! Come on, Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.82,0:03:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let this plan work!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.66,0:03:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it kind of weird that we haven't\Nhad any new workers in nearly a year?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard they don't even\Nvisit the palace anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's slacking on the clock?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.38,0:04:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You would think when 500 of\Nyou people don't return home,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd start to worry something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet the Tontadas\Ndon't suspect a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They are so incredibly dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.32,0:04:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, pure-hearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.64,0:04:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So why do you think\Nthey stopped showing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.10,0:04:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if we can't enslave anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll have to work the butts\Noff the 500 we already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How about some job now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This smile fruit doesn't\Nlook ripe enough yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.34,0:05:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Start talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.68,0:05:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Tontata could grow\Nanything, so what's with this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We usually can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,These smile fruits aren't\Nexactly natural, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.58,0:05:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, no excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.62,0:05:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you give my brother a\Nfew minutes to rest, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.22,0:05:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's meal was a little\Nbit spoiled, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.86,0:05:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're complaining about the food?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to cure your princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know just how sick Mon Cherie is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then get your ass back\Nto farming more fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You know they're an essential\Ningredient in making her medication,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.78,0:05:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,or did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The number of acceptable\Nfruits you produce in one
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:06:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,season is less than 10 %\Nof what you're harvesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to find a way to\Nincrease your productivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think we could\Nsee Princess Moncheree?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.94,0:06:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if you were to contract her\Nillness, we would be devastated. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We would never forgive\Nourselves if we allowed anything
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,terrible to happen to our\Nbeloved Alto partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, Mr. Underling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.32,0:06:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to push ourselves\Nto work even harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please continue to take\Ngood care of our princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.94,0:06:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so gullible. I almost feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Robaland?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why stop me? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.84,0:06:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if I hadn't done something,\Nthen you would have gotten hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.02,0:06:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That fly he sniped?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.98,0:07:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He somehow shot it right between the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Treble's vision must be exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And his aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.50,0:07:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it's far too\Ndangerous to approach Sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,While he's watching over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you got anything for a plan B?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That goes there
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up with this cargo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a swarm of pink ornets!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an urgent report from Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.94,0:07:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.86,0:07:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Eve's pirates are causing\Na disturbance in Sector 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They are demanding to speak to an\Nexecutive about renegotiating the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.22,0:07:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, they think they don't have\Nto be afraid of Joker anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.02,0:07:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That takes some nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.92,0:08:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're not the regular messenger,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.66,0:08:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's on a lunch break right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all—it's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.04,0:08:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's already been a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,few New casualties reported!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Casualties, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.54,0:08:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.34,0:08:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you headed somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tighten up security at the four doors\Nto the Executive Tower. Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.56,0:08:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And if anything goes wrong, do\Nlet me know at once. Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Treble, keep up the good work, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.22,0:08:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So where is he? Where's\Nthe fight? This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I could handle this mess easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.32,0:09:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.23,0:09:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think I should let you guys do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,To build up your self-confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.36,0:09:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything goes wrong, I'll\Njump in and take over, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.28,0:09:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.19,0:09:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here on a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,we are going to rescue our friends\Nwho are enslaved here in the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.16,0:09:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, we're going to knock\Nyou out cold, sugar! But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.48,0:09:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so mean. I don't know\Nanything about your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.82,0:09:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Truly?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.56,0:09:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Aw, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being fooled!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, close one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll free our friends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.72,0:09:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who brought you up to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.54,0:09:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been cheating you for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:10:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and you little dimwits\Nnever had so much as a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I was curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You used to come to the\Npalace all the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.84,0:10:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but I haven't seen you in the past year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.32,0:10:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess somebody has\Nbeen leading you astray.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.98,0:10:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang her mouth open and hold her still!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.62,0:10:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not amused.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like it when\Npeople think I'm weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're all little black bears!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.14,0:10:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, she turned us into toys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall follow my every\Norder until the day you perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.46,0:10:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me they\Nforgot about us already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A bear army?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.94,0:10:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did all those\Nteddy soldiers come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And weren't we in the middle\Nof something just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.06,0:11:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill everyone in the executive\Ntower and do it immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.50,0:11:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't disobey her orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Including me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I don't want to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Those bears must be working for Sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the only one she\Nhad guarding her was Treble,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but it looks like we were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.98,0:11:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo, it's me, Flapper!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.76,0:11:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, guys, get the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Treble, come back at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.16,0:11:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Treble!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.84,0:11:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Treble, please look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all starting to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's utter chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.98,0:11:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! You guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard there's a dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.46,0:12:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Master trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.92,0:12:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, go on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's basically nothing, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just a bit jumpy because\Nwe found hornets in our cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, this won't\Nhave any effect on our deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.46,0:12:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She did lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.64,0:12:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.26,0:12:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.02,0:12:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try! Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.36,0:12:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you, uh, a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did she go? Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.56,0:12:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, I know her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in the strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That crew? How'd she get down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.86,0:12:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they going after Sugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:12:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You were fooled, you\Ngood-for-nothing idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.68,0:12:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Die! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm mad now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stinky, stinky, shay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stick, stick him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteora!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.38,0:13:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Master Trouble is going crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The executive tower. It's gonna wreck it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.42,0:14:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.33,0:14:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried. Robin! Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.36,0:14:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we just get crushed by a big duck?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.90,0:14:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The tentata have all been captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop dead, you crap head!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.64,0:14:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you die first, you little brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.12,0:14:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're having a\Nserious conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So buzz off, you ready to talk yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I just said I'm not talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.02,0:14:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep Usuland safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.42,0:14:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run while we still can, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.42,0:15:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth is, he's a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.34,0:15:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can tell me. He is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Usuland? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.14,0:15:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.52,0:15:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, you really think\Nhe's my friend? Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.84,0:15:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell right into your trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you friends with that\None-legged soldier, too? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, guess I can talk about it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.06,0:15:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I didn't know. I'm a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.23,0:15:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finally getting a clear picture now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, it doesn't matter if you know or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are finished either way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.70,0:15:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're bringing them back no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're sharing secrets\Nright now, I'll tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.82,0:16:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.42,0:16:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.54,0:16:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.74,0:16:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have made him angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys gave it your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But Treble is out of our league.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.82,0:16:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll finish Operation SOB.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.16,0:16:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Our friends are counting on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.06,0:16:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to help him defeat Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.06,0:17:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't stop until he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.14,0:17:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.80,0:17:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And we cannot let him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.02,0:17:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.46,0:17:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's leaving the warlords?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's stepping down\Nfrom the throne, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.76,0:17:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's nothing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.48,0:17:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A plain old pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:17:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy won't let him\Nget away with his crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.48,0:18:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And this coliseum's going\Nto be the first thing to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, did you see the newspaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, get our friends back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And we don't even have to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think of how many\Nlives will be saved by this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.54,0:18:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're lucky! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.20,0:18:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a false report.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.32,0:18:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.26,0:18:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not leaving after all! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.20,0:18:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamenco's a great king!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason why he\Nshould ever step down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.18,0:18:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Our kingdom is saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.98,0:18:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to enter today's competition\Nand win the Plain Plain Fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.08,0:18:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, I'll be able\Nto defeat Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.50,0:18:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.41,0:18:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Have patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.88,0:18:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you're angry,\Nand I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But the end is at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.46,0:18:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My forces are ready to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.38,0:18:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle this myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.94,0:18:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've waited! Long enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.24,0:18:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Our hopes have been dropped\Nfrom heaven to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.06,0:18:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The fighters can't take this anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.22,0:19:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Their spirits are broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.34,0:19:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All we can do now is\Nwait till the day we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They say they'll release us if\Nwe survive a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But how is that supposed to give us hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just more misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The gladiator Kiros won\Nall 3,000 of his matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.36,0:19:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's just a stupid legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No one even remembers him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.02,0:19:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiros was probably made\Nup by a bunch of prisoners
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.32,0:19:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,who were holding on to\Na dream of being free.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's just a statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.50,0:19:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A perfect warrior who\Ncould never really exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of dreaming an\Nimpossible dream, so I'll fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.82,0:19:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The competition today is my\None chance, so I'm taking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a suicide mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.52,0:19:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not talking about a\Ntypical gladiator match.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.56,0:19:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll end up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I forbid you to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not thinking straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.10,0:19:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You are only 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.60,0:19:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, I simply know better than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.82,0:19:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not an adult yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know what's good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.34,0:20:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.74,0:20:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop acting like you're my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the one who's not\Nthinking straight here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You can handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.26,0:20:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what your plan is,\Nbut you can't beat the flamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.76,0:20:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.94,0:20:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a broken toy with one leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.64,0:20:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for being so menacing,\Nbut if you can, please do not fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Seltzer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.84,0:20:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We can talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.26,0:20:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.88,0:20:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Seltzer, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.34,0:20:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.52,0:20:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want you to\Nsacrifice yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.32,0:20:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.26,0:20:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just so worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.66,0:20:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.74,0:21:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've\Never seen Rebecca attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She's going on the offensive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.96,0:21:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what's with that sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.88,0:21:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The blade isn't even sharp, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.84,0:21:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In this coliseum we fight\Nto the death if you won't
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,shed the blood of others\NYou'll pay with your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what the audience\Nwants to see after all. Now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.20,0:22:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Muscle melon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.00,0:22:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.12,0:22:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect her for me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.52,0:22:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.43,0:22:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Rebecca, here's a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.32,0:22:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you happen to know how\Nyour dear Mother Scarlet died?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.46,0:22:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to bring us something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.54,0:22:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw the toy soldier that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.82,0:22:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He cried like a baby. Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.42,0:22:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.46,0:22:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.72,0:22:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed to protect your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.88,0:22:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not just my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.24,0:22:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Pika must be moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's dealing\Nwith someone as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.80,0:22:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.86,0:23:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.20,0:23:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.50,0:23:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to move! Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.50,0:23:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be hurt if we don't help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.18,0:23:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your paws off me,\Nyoung little bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.18,0:23:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop looking back, Commander. Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.10,0:23:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.14,0:23:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We all knew what we signed up for.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.32,0:23:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.44,0:23:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you stay here, then everyone might die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.32,0:23:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Leo pulls off Operation\NSOP, it's still not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.48,0:23:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If we let Doflamingo walk away, he\Ncan do the same thing all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.70,0:23:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Or even worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else can beat Toe Flamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.72,0:23:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.04,0:23:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the commander really\Nsuch a big deal, Leo?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.56,0:23:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems kind of crazy to\Nbet everything on one guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.16,0:23:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you trust him so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.72,0:23:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just a one-legged toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, when Sugar\Nturns someone into a toy,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.16,0:23:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,they're bound by the contract she makes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.56,0:23:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,meaning they can't disobey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.66,0:23:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why they're able to\Nkeep them all as slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.14,0:24:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But unlike them, the commander's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.94,0:24:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the first one\Nhere to be transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.68,0:24:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So that time when Sugar\Nused her hobby-hobby power,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.74,0:24:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,she made a mistake and forgot\Nto form a contract with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.20,0:24:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,One little error from\Nmore than ten years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.98,0:24:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,gave them a powerful\Nenemy like none other.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.68,0:24:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the only toy in this kingdom who can\Nstrike back at the Don Quixote family.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.60,0:24:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A toy who can take revenge for them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.84,0:24:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For a whole decade,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.44,0:24:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,he's been fighting on his own, but he\Nnever gave up and he never lost hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.08,0:24:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew the truth about the toys\Nand how much they were suffering,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.08,0:24:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,slaving away and forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.94,0:24:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In time, all our people would\Nhave been enslaved as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.00,0:24:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but thanks to him, now\Nwe're able to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.70,0:25:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If he calls us to arms, we have to answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.42,0:25:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, this kingdom\Nis as good as dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.76,0:25:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.06,0:25:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're proud to bet\Neverything we've got on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.26,0:25:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody remembers him now, but years ago,\Neveryone in the kingdom knew who he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.48,0:25:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Before he got transformed into\Na toy, his name was Kiros.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.92,0:25:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the strongest gladiator\Nthat the Colosseum had ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.08,0:25:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's who our commander is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.94,0:25:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A legendary hero.
